msg-mineb02-0 = 
    你遇见$NamedOneName，此矿中那群惹事生非的矮人之王。他咬牙切齿，向你尖声怒吼。<br><p>         Horrible nuisances,<br>          You are too near to my<br>          treasures and magic, so<br>          Please go away.<br>          I do not wish you to<br>          Go any further. So<br>          If you still value your<br>          lives, do not stay.<br><p>
    你...<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>与矮人商谈。<br><p><opt>...<indent>从他身旁擦肩而过，深入矿井。
msg-mineb02-1 = 
    $NamedOneName 激怒地跳跃，口中胡言乱语。你几乎听不懂他说的话。<br><p>         Germany mourns for you,<br>          You shall be crushed to death,<br>          Gnome fountain stronghold can<br>          You ne'er defeat.<br><p>
    你伸手取武器，但他一戴红帽，即刻消失无踪。你置其威胁于不顾，继续前行。你细思其言——他曾提及“矮人喷泉”。
